translation.guardrails.settingOptions.logOnly.label	Log only
translation.guardrails.settingOptions.logOnly.description	The violation is recorded but no action is taken. The session continues normally.
translation.guardrails.settingOptions.warnUser.label	Warn user
translation.guardrails.settingOptions.warnUser.description	The message is processed, but the user sees a warning banner. The violation is logged.
translation.guardrails.settingOptions.blockMessage.label	Block message
translation.guardrails.settingOptions.blockMessage.description	The flagged message is blocked from being processed. The session remains active.
